# HealthCore nightly telemetry export (Ticket #DEV-53)
#
# Sole production trigger: OS crontab, outside FastAPI. CRON_TZ=UTC.
# 00:05 UTC so TARGET_DATE defaults to the completed previous UTC calendar day.
#
# Operator configuration:
# Replace every occurrence of /path/to/repo with the absolute path of this
# repository checkout (the directory that contains scripts/ and data/).
# Do not use a container-only working directory.
#
# The launcher uses services/api/.venv/bin/python when present, sets PYTHONPATH,
# loads secrets via services/api/.env inside the worker, and runs:
#   python scripts/nightly_export.py
#
SHELL=/bin/sh
CRON_TZ=UTC
5 0 * * * /bin/sh /path/to/repo/scripts/run_nightly_export.sh >> /path/to/repo/data/raw/nightly_export.log 2>&1
